# ── capture automation — local only, NEVER publish ────────────────────
# The whole toolchain that drives and reads the phone. Ignored wholesale
# (allowlist style) so a new tool added later is private by default rather
# than published by accident.
tools/
Capture Console.command
static-server.mjs
.claude/

# ── captured data ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Screenshots of friend profiles, per-run CSVs, corrections and the merge
# cache. Real people's handles and stats — none of it leaves the machine.
captures/
/data/
*-with-names.csv

# The cap-80 (v2) dataset is derived from those captures and is not published
# until that phase is finished and deliberately released.
site/data/era2.json

# ── local-only working notes ──────────────────────────────────────────
THEME-HANDOFF.md
DEV-HANDOFF.md

# ── OS / editor cruft ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# ── python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/

# ── node ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
